00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:19.450
Each week, we will break down an episode of The Office and give exclusive behind-the-scenes stories that only two people who were there can tell you.
每周，我们都会剖析一集《办公室》，并分享只有身临其境的我们两人才能告诉你的独家幕后故事。

7
00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:20.590
We're The Office ladies.
我们是《办公室》女士。

8
00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:25.490
Lady Luck, roll those dice.
幸运女神，掷出骰子吧。

9
00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:26.970
It's casino night, everyone.
各位，赌场之夜到了。

10
00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:28.390
Oh, baby.
噢，宝贝。

11
00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:29.790
Yes, it is.
没错，就是这样。

12
00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:31.890
I'm so excited for this episode.
我对这一集感到非常兴奋。

13
