Really quickly before we get started, you guys, you know, we're recording from home right now.
在开始之前，各位，你们知道我们现在是在家里录音。

17
00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:47.170
Yep.
没错。

18
00:00:47.410 --> 00:00:49.150
