00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:41.150
Written by Steve Carell, directed by Ken Quapas.
史蒂夫·卡瑞尔编剧，肯·夸皮斯执导。

38
00:01:41.270 --> 00:01:43.530
This is already off to a good start, Jenna.
珍娜，这已经是一个很好的开始了。

39
00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:44.550
Oh, yeah.
噢，没错。

40
00:01:44.710 --> 00:01:45.870
