48
00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:09.970
Yeah.
没错。

49
00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:14.410
And that's going to lead him to ponder his relationship with Pam.
而这会让他开始思考自己与帕姆的关系。

50
00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:15.490
It's a good one.
这一集很精彩。

51
00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:17.530
Should we get into some Sam?
