Fast fact!
冷知识！

53
00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:19.430
Yeah!
耶！

54
00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:25.920
Fast fact number one, written by Steve Carell.
冷知识第一条，由史蒂夫·卡瑞尔撰写。

55
00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:26.580
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

56
