783
00:34:16.720 --> 00:34:17.440
I know.
我知道。

784
00:34:17.580 --> 00:34:23.440
I'm not sure if Brain did it or if it was like one of the writer pitches on set, because we would have writers on set that would pitch us jokes.
我不确定是布莱恩加的，还是现场编剧给的建议，因为我们现场会有编剧提供笑话。

785
00:34:23.440 --> 00:34:28.660
But the original line was supposed to be no sign of date number two.
但原本的台词应该是“没看到二号约会对象的踪影”。

786
00:34:29.500 --> 00:34:35.900
Which is also very funny because it is in no way coded and also out loud.
那也很好笑，因为这根本算不上什么代号，而且还是大声说出来的。

787
00:34:35.900 --> 00:34:37.720
He says Michael has a second date.
他说迈克尔有第二个约会对象。

788
00:34:37.940 --> 00:34:38.400
All right.
好吧。

789
00:34:38.400 --> 00:34:45.740
So, Jenna, at 18 minutes, 26 seconds, I have a card called Kiss Slap Smirk.
那么，珍娜，在18分26秒的时候，我有个卡片叫“亲吻、掌掴、坏笑”。

790
00:34:46.060 --> 00:34:47.800
Oh, this is a classic.
噢，这是经典桥段。

791
00:34:48.040 --> 00:34:50.380
This is a classic Dwight Angela moment.
这是德怀特和安吉拉的经典时刻。

792
00:34:50.620 --> 00:34:57.720
It's when Dwight is playing craps and Angela walks up in her little black dress and she's like, what are you doing?
当时德怀特在玩掷骰子游戏，安吉拉穿着她的小黑裙走过来问他在干什么。

793
00:34:57.720 --> 00:35:01.220
And they're very formal with one another, you know, very formal.
他们对彼此非常正式，你知道，非常正式。

794
00:35:01.460 --> 00:35:04.280
And he's like, Angela, I need to roll an eight and everyone wins.
他说，安吉拉，我得掷出个八点，大家就都赢了。

795
00:35:04.380 --> 00:35:05.900
And she says, so roll an eight.
她说，那就掷个八点啊。

796
00:35:06.280 --> 00:35:07.800
And then he does.
然后他就掷出来了。

797
00:35:07.980 --> 00:35:08.440
Yes.
没错。

798
00:35:08.880 --> 00:35:14.240
And he is so excited that he grabs you and he kisses you on the cheek.
他太兴奋了，一把抓住你，亲了你的脸颊。

799
00:35:14.540 --> 00:35:15.420
I know.
我知道。

800
00:35:15.420 --> 00:35:21.780
And listen, even though maybe she's happy about that, she has to slap him for being inappropriate at work.
听着，尽管她可能对此感到高兴，但她必须打他一巴掌，因为他在工作场合举止不当。

801
00:35:22.000 --> 00:35:22.400
Yes.
是的。

802
00:35:23.040 --> 00:35:26.420
Well, Angela, we got a fan question from Heather Lindo.
好的，安吉拉，我们收到了一条来自希瑟·林多的粉丝提问。

803
00:35:26.420 --> 00:35:28.040
Sam, will you play it?
山姆，能放一下吗？

804
00:35:28.340 --> 00:35:28.760
Hi, Jenna.
嗨，珍娜。

805
00:35:28.980 --> 00:35:29.480
Hi, Angela.
嗨，安吉拉。

806
00:35:30.200 --> 00:35:34.080
Casino Night is one of my very favorite episodes for a lot of reasons.
《赌场之夜》是我最喜欢的剧集之一，原因有很多。

807
00:35:34.080 --> 00:35:41.320
And one of them being the scene at the craps table when Dwight kisses Angela for good luck and then she slaps him.
其中之一就是骰子桌的那场戏，德怀特为了好运亲了安吉拉，然后被她扇了一巴掌。

808
00:35:41.600 --> 00:35:45.080
But when she turns around, her face is just perfection.
但当她转过身时，她的表情简直绝了。

809
00:35:45.380 --> 00:35:48.620
She cycles through like 10 emotions in a matter of like three seconds.
她在三秒钟内变换了大概十种情绪。

810
00:35:48.800 --> 00:35:55.100
She is horrified and thrilled and embarrassed and obviously deep down very happy all at the same time.
她同时表现出惊恐、兴奋、尴尬，显然内心深处还非常高兴。

811
00:35:55.100 --> 00:35:56.640
And I just love it.
我真的太喜欢那一幕了。

812
00:35:56.780 --> 00:36:02.640
And Angela, my question is, did you nail that on the first take or did you have to do it many, many times?
安吉拉，我的问题是，你是第一条就拍好了，还是拍了很多很多次？

813
00:36:02.840 --> 00:36:05.440
Thank you so much for letting me ask my question.
非常感谢让我提问。

814
00:36:05.600 --> 00:36:10.220
I know everyone says this, but my sister Kim and I really are the office number one fans.
我知道每个人都这么说，但我妹妹金和我真的是《办公室》的头号粉丝。

815
00:36:10.320 --> 00:36:11.220
We just love you so much.
我们真的太爱你们了。

816
00:36:11.320 --> 00:36:11.800
So thank you.
所以谢谢你们。

817
00:36:12.080 --> 00:36:14.710
So sweet.
太贴心了。

818
00:36:14.710 --> 00:36:16.350
I love that question so much.
我非常喜欢这个问题。

819
00:36:16.350 --> 00:36:17.630
Um, okay.
嗯，好的。

820
00:36:17.850 --> 00:36:23.890
So I was very excited about this question because I actually wrote in my journal about the scene.
我对这个问题感到非常兴奋，因为我当时确实在日记里写过这场戏。

821
00:36:24.130 --> 00:36:25.150
Of course you did.
你当然写了。

822
00:36:25.350 --> 00:36:25.990
Of course we did.
我们当然写了。

823
00:36:26.090 --> 00:36:28.030
I wrote about it the week we filmed it.
我在拍摄那一周就写下了这件事。

824
00:36:28.030 --> 00:36:33.070
To answer your question, Heather, no, I did not get it right the first time.
回答你的问题，希瑟，不，我没能一次就拍好。

825
00:36:33.330 --> 00:36:33.750
Okay.
好吧。

826
00:36:33.810 --> 00:36:37.130
So I wrote that I was really nervous to slap Rain at firSt.
我写道，起初我真的很紧张，不敢扇雷恩。

827
00:36:37.250 --> 00:36:38.850
You know, my slap was kind of timid.
你知道，我的巴掌有点软绵绵的。

828
00:36:39.070 --> 00:36:42.730
Which makes sense because you were probably very, you were worried about hurting him.
这很正常，因为你可能很担心会伤到他。

829
00:36:43.210 --> 00:36:43.670
Exactly.
没错。

830
00:36:43.670 --> 00:36:44.750
I didn't want to hurt him.
我不想伤害他。

831
00:36:44.890 --> 00:36:46.150
And it wasn't a fake slap.
而且那不是假打。

832
00:36:46.390 --> 00:36:47.790
They told you to really slap him.
他们让你真的扇他。

833
00:36:47.870 --> 00:36:49.870
That was, they were never did a phony slap.
那是，他们从不搞假打那一套。

834
00:36:50.070 --> 00:36:51.570
No, they wanted a real slap.
不，他们想要真实的巴掌。

835
00:36:51.810 --> 00:36:54.830
And well, I guess my timid little slap wasn't working.
好吧，我想我那软绵绵的小巴掌没起作用。

836
00:36:55.210 --> 00:36:58.470
So Rain said, listen, Ange, just go for it.
所以雷恩说，听着，安吉，尽管来吧。

837
00:36:58.530 --> 00:36:59.610
I can take it.
我受得住。

838
00:36:59.870 --> 00:37:03.070
So I started really slapping him.
于是我开始真的用力扇他。

839
00:37:03.330 --> 00:37:03.790
Oh no.
噢，不。

840
00:37:04.070 --> 00:37:07.930
And I wrote that it took us about 13 takes to get.
我写道，我们拍了大约13条才过。

841
00:37:07.990 --> 00:37:08.390
Oh no.
噢，不。

842
00:37:08.630 --> 00:37:09.010
Yes.
是的。

843
00:37:09.570 --> 00:37:09.910
Angela.
安吉拉。

844
00:37:10.450 --> 00:37:12.170
That's 13 slaps.
那是13个巴掌啊。

845
00:37:12.430 --> 00:37:12.890
All right.
好吧。

846
00:37:13.670 --> 00:37:14.890
One thing I need you guys to remember.
有一件事我需要你们记住。

847
00:37:15.090 --> 00:37:16.550
I am 5'1".
我身高5英尺1英寸。

848
00:37:16.550 --> 00:37:18.430
Rain is like 6'3".
雷恩大概有6英尺3英寸。

849
00:37:18.430 --> 00:37:21.670
So it wasn't really easy for me to reach his cheek.
所以对我来说，够到他的脸颊并不容易。

850
00:37:21.950 --> 00:37:29.150
And one time my aim was really off and I missed his cheek and I slapped his ear so hard.
有一次我准头太差，没打到脸颊，结果狠狠地扇在了他的耳朵上。

851
00:37:29.530 --> 00:37:31.570
He was like, I'd actually hurt him.
他说，我真的伤到他了。

852
00:37:31.690 --> 00:37:33.170
You said there was like a ringing in his ear.
你说过他耳朵里好像有耳鸣声。

853
00:37:33.370 --> 00:37:38.570
And then the other time I missed and I, I slapped and I hit his glasses and I knocked them
还有一次我没打准，我扇过去的时候打到了他的眼镜，把眼镜

854
00:37:38.570 --> 00:37:40.210
sideways on his face.
打歪在了他脸上。

855
00:37:40.490 --> 00:37:40.950
I know.
我知道。

856
00:37:41.230 --> 00:37:41.750
Angela.
安吉拉。

857
00:37:42.050 --> 00:37:42.310
I know.
我知道。

858
00:37:42.830 --> 00:37:48.290
Well, I want to go back to something that Heather said too about that look on your face
嗯，我想回到希瑟刚才说的关于你走开时

859
00:37:48.290 --> 00:37:49.650
as you're walking away.
脸上的那个表情。

860
00:37:49.810 --> 00:37:49.970
Yeah.
是的。

861
00:37:50.110 --> 00:37:52.430
Because it is, it is amazing.
因为那真的，真的很绝。

862
00:37:52.430 --> 00:37:59.390
And I have the script and I looked it up and all it says is that you slapped Dwight and that
我看了剧本，上面只写了你扇了德怀特，然后

863
00:37:59.390 --> 00:38:02.410
you smile as you walk away from the table.
你从桌边走开时笑了。

864
00:38:02.670 --> 00:38:05.690
I think there's so much more going on in your face.
我觉得你脸上的表情远不止于此。

865
00:38:05.770 --> 00:38:10.670
So your character is angry that Dwight would kiss you so publicly and all of that.
所以你的角色是因为德怀特在那种公开场合亲吻你而生气，诸如此类。

866
00:38:10.670 --> 00:38:16.210
But, but what I love is that you have this little look to the camera at the very end.
但我最喜欢的是，在最后你对着镜头露出的那个小表情。

867
00:38:16.310 --> 00:38:18.770
It's like 18 minutes, 48 seconds.
大概在18分48秒的时候。

868
00:38:19.150 --> 00:38:19.630
Yeah.
是的。

869
00:38:19.810 --> 00:38:24.350
Where you sort of catch the camera catching you smiling.
你好像意识到镜头捕捉到了你在偷笑。

870
00:38:24.650 --> 00:38:24.790
Right.
没错。

871
00:38:25.010 --> 00:38:26.390
That camera catch was not in the script.
那个镜头捕捉并不是剧本里写的。

872
00:38:26.390 --> 00:38:27.450
Was that improvised?
那是即兴发挥的吗？

873
00:38:27.790 --> 00:38:28.930
Yes, it was.
是的，是即兴的。

874
00:38:29.170 --> 00:38:29.310
Okay.
好的。

875
00:38:29.430 --> 00:38:34.030
So that, that just happened on the day, that little moment where I'm busted at the end.
所以那是在拍摄当天自然发生的，就是最后我被抓包的那个小瞬间。

876
00:38:34.390 --> 00:38:39.690
So in one of the early takes, I was walking out of frame and I just looked at camera
在早期的一次拍摄中，我正走出画面，我只是看了一眼镜头，

877
00:38:39.690 --> 00:38:41.210
and I quickly looked away.
然后又迅速移开了视线。

878
00:38:41.350 --> 00:38:43.050
Like I was embarrassed that they caught me smiling.
就像因为被拍到在笑而感到尴尬一样。

879
00:38:43.270 --> 00:38:47.310
And our director of photography, Randall Einhorn said, Ange, Ange, I caught it.
我们的摄影指导兰德尔·艾因霍恩说，安吉，安吉，我拍到了。

880
00:38:47.390 --> 00:38:49.430
I caught it right at the end as you're leaving frame.
就在你离开画面的那一刻，我拍到了。

881
00:38:49.750 --> 00:38:52.090
And he really helped me find that moment.
他真的帮我找到了那个瞬间。

882
00:38:52.430 --> 00:38:53.830
Then he showed it to our director.
然后他给我们的导演看了。

883
00:38:54.010 --> 00:38:55.010
Our director loved it.
我们的导演很喜欢。

884
00:38:55.350 --> 00:39:00.430
And so Randall was like, Ange, you don't have a lot of time to cycle through all that, but
所以兰德尔就说，安吉，你没有太多时间去演绎所有这些情绪，但

885
00:39:00.430 --> 00:39:04.310
I'm going to catch it every time if you glance the camera and quickly look away embarrassed.
只要你瞥一眼镜头然后尴尬地迅速移开，我每次都能捕捉到。

886
00:39:04.810 --> 00:39:08.590
So I have to thank Randall for that because he really helped me make that moment happen.
所以我得感谢兰德尔，因为他真的帮我成就了那个瞬间。

887
00:39:08.590 --> 00:39:09.870
And I love that.
我太喜欢那个了。

888
00:39:10.010 --> 00:39:10.550
Yes.
是的。

889
00:39:10.910 --> 00:39:15.690
All right, folks out there that love background catches, I have one more moment for you in
好了，各位喜欢捕捉背景细节的朋友们，在这个小场景里，

890
00:39:15.690 --> 00:39:19.530
this little scene at 18 minutes, 51 seconds.
在18分51秒处，我还有一个瞬间要分享给你们。

891
00:39:19.810 --> 00:39:24.690
You can really see how red the side of Randall's face is.
你们真的能看到兰德尔脸侧有多红。

892
00:39:24.990 --> 00:39:28.370
And it's because I have slapped him 13 times.
那是因为我扇了他13次。

893
00:39:29.850 --> 00:39:31.770
Well, there you have it.
好吧，真相大白了。

894
00:39:32.070 --> 00:39:33.890
Heather, thank you for such a great question.
希瑟，谢谢你提出了这么棒的问题。

895
00:39:34.210 --> 00:39:34.910
Thank you, Heather.
谢谢你，希瑟。

896
00:39:34.910 --> 00:39:36.130
Heather, I love that question.
希瑟，我太喜欢这个问题了。

897
00:39:36.510 --> 00:39:43.710
Okay, so Angela, you just described the big kind of Dwight-Angela flirt moment that happens
好的，安吉拉，你刚才描述了德怀特和安吉拉在赌场之夜

898
00:39:43.710 --> 00:39:46.750
in front of everybody at the casino night.
当着所有人的面调情的那个大场面。

899
00:39:46.850 --> 00:39:51.590
So now we head over to the poker table where it is heads up between Jim and Pam.
现在我们转到扑克桌，那是吉姆和帕姆的单挑对决。

900
00:39:51.650 --> 00:39:56.890
And I feel like this is the big Jim-Pam flirt moment that's public.
我觉得这就是吉姆和帕姆公开调情的大场面。

901
00:39:57.150 --> 00:39:59.350
There is so much flirting happening.
这里到处都在调情。

902
00:39:59.350 --> 00:40:04.250
Pam is basically doing the giggle hair toss move from about last night.
帕姆基本上是在重现昨晚那个娇笑撩发的动作。

903
00:40:04.750 --> 00:40:06.930
I mean, it is on.
我是说，好戏开场了。

904
00:40:07.110 --> 00:40:07.710
It is on.
好戏开场了。

905
00:40:07.730 --> 00:40:10.710
Well, we had a fan question from Live Love California.
好，我们收到一个来自“Live Love California”的粉丝提问。

906
00:40:11.010 --> 00:40:15.450
The scene at the poker table when you and John are making those faces back and forth,
扑克桌上你和约翰互相做鬼脸的那场戏，

907
00:40:15.510 --> 00:40:18.270
was that improvised or scripted?
那是即兴发挥还是剧本写的？

908
00:40:18.610 --> 00:40:20.150
This is what was scripted.
剧本里写的是这样的。

909
00:40:20.310 --> 00:40:21.470
Those little looks between us.
我们之间那些小眼神。

910
00:40:21.650 --> 00:40:22.810
There was a scene description.
剧本里有场景描述。

911
00:40:22.810 --> 00:40:25.610
And so what you're seeing is John and I's interpretation.
所以你们看到的，就是我和约翰的演绎。

912
00:40:26.170 --> 00:40:28.850
This is what it says right after Jim's line.
吉姆的台词之后写的是这样的。

913
00:40:29.150 --> 00:40:29.890
You're bluffing.
你在虚张声势。

914
00:40:30.330 --> 00:40:33.450
Pam makes a playful gesture like, who knows?
帕姆做了一个俏皮的手势，好像在说，谁知道呢？

915
00:40:33.830 --> 00:40:35.730
Jim stares at her intensely.
吉姆深情地盯着她。

916
00:40:36.190 --> 00:40:39.350
She smiles her best enigmatic smile.
她露出了她最神秘的微笑。

917
00:40:39.790 --> 00:40:42.230
Jim enjoys this woman so much.
吉姆非常欣赏这个女人。

918
00:40:42.430 --> 00:40:45.390
He finally has to break eye contact and shake it off.
他最终不得不移开目光，让自己清醒一下。

919
00:40:45.730 --> 00:40:51.310
Oh, so that was what John and I, we had to take that note in the script.
哦，所以这就是我和约翰必须根据剧本要求去演的内容。

920
00:40:51.310 --> 00:40:53.910
And that's what made that scene.
那场戏就是这样成就的。

921
00:40:54.190 --> 00:40:55.410
Oh, that's so good.
哦，太棒了。

922
00:40:55.410 --> 00:40:56.750
I love that.
我喜欢这个。

923
00:40:57.190 --> 00:40:57.610
Yeah.
是啊。

924
00:40:57.930 --> 00:40:59.110
I love that.
我喜欢这个。

925
00:40:59.570 --> 00:41:04.670
Well, I have a question that's not related to you guys flirting, but at 19 minutes, 26
好吧，我有个问题跟你们俩调情无关，但在19分26秒的时候，

926
00:41:04.670 --> 00:41:06.190
seconds, what the heck?
到底是怎么回事？

927
00:41:06.330 --> 00:41:10.650
So Kevin wears glasses when he plays poker, but he doesn't wear glasses to be an accountant?
凯文打扑克时戴眼镜，但他当会计时却不戴眼镜？

928
00:41:11.210 --> 00:41:15.090
Angela, we literally got a fan question that said the same thing.
安吉拉，我们真的收到过一个问同样问题的粉丝来信。

929
00:41:15.230 --> 00:41:16.170
What's up?
怎么回事？

930
00:41:16.650 --> 00:41:20.490
My theory about that is that he doesn't care about being an accountant.
我的理论是，他根本不在乎当会计这件事。

931
00:41:21.970 --> 00:41:28.290
But as he tells us, he has won one of the satellite games in the World Series of Poker.
但正如他告诉我们的，他曾赢得过世界扑克系列赛的一场卫星赛。

932
00:41:28.390 --> 00:41:30.230
He's an avid poker player, this guy.
这家伙可是个狂热的扑克玩家。

933
00:41:30.610 --> 00:41:32.850
He's a different person when he's playing poker.
他打扑克时完全是另一个人。

