我知道这个故事我已经讲过无数遍了。

1277
00:56:14.640 --> 00:56:15.820
So people are like, we get it.
所以大家都会说，我们知道了。

1278
00:56:15.940 --> 00:56:16.960
We've seen behind the scenes.
我们看过幕后花絮了。

1279
00:56:18.240 --> 00:56:23.700
Um, I, I genuinely had like a metaphysical event where I was like, Oh, that's who's in
嗯，我，我当时真的有一种超自然的感应，心想，噢，原来这就是剧里的人。

1280
00:56:23.700 --> 00:56:24.000
the show.
那个人会出现在剧里。

1281
00:56:24.180 --> 00:56:25.380
That person will be in the show.
那个人会出现在剧里。

1282
00:56:25.740 --> 00:56:27.020
And so they held me back.
所以他们把我留下了。

1283
00:56:27.140 --> 00:56:28.480
You went in with a bunch of people.
你是和一群人一起进去的。

1284
00:56:29.240 --> 00:56:33.340
And I remember thinking, if I don't go in with her, I'm screwed.
我记得当时想，如果我不跟她一起进去，我就完蛋了。

1285
00:56:33.800 --> 00:56:36.120
And that's when I went on the thing and said, you should let me go.
就在那时我走过去说，你们应该让我走。

1286
00:56:36.220 --> 00:56:36.780
And they said, no, no, no.
他们说，不不不。

1287
00:56:36.860 --> 00:56:38.460
There's one more person we want you to audition with.
还有一个人我们想让你一起试镜。

1288
00:56:38.500 --> 00:56:39.100
And it was you.
那个人就是你。

1289
00:56:39.440 --> 00:56:42.000
And I thought, Oh my God, you're saying there's a chance.
我当时想，天哪，你是说还有机会。

1290
00:56:42.100 --> 00:56:44.020
Cause if I'm in with you, I knew I had a shot.
因为如果能和你一起试镜，我就知道我有戏了。

1291
00:56:44.020 --> 00:56:51.920
Oh my God, John, I can go back to that moment that I saw you at the audition and I had that
天哪，约翰，我能回想起在试镜时看到你的那一刻，我当时也有

1292
00:56:51.920 --> 00:56:53.820
exact same reaction.
完全一样的反应。

1293
00:56:53.820 --> 00:57:01.420
I, it was, I've tried to describe it to people like what it was like to audition with you.
我，我试着向别人描述和你一起试镜是什么感觉。

1294
00:57:02.380 --> 00:57:09.140
And the best, like the best explanation I could come up with was like, what if you walked into a
我能想到的最好的解释就是，就像你走进一个

1295
00:57:09.140 --> 00:57:15.500
room and music started playing and you and another person just started dancing in unison, even though
房间，音乐响起，你和另一个人就开始同步跳起舞来，尽管

1296
00:57:15.500 --> 00:57:16.320
you'd never met.
你们从未见过面。

1297
00:57:16.900 --> 00:57:19.000
But that's what it was like auditioning with you.
和你试镜的感觉就是那样。

1298
00:57:19.220 --> 00:57:19.320
Wow.
哇。

1299
00:57:19.420 --> 00:57:23.400
That's really way more beautiful than what I would say, which is like, I felt like I could see the
这比我要说的要美妙得多，我想说的是，我感觉我能看到

1300
00:57:23.400 --> 00:57:23.780
future.
未来。

