00:58:21.020 --> 00:58:21.420
I don't know.
我不知道。

1323
00:58:21.520 --> 00:58:22.160
What's the etiquette.
礼仪是什么样的。

1324
00:58:22.300 --> 00:58:26.320
And so when you said, I think you're going to get the role of Pam, my memory is that
