1366
01:00:31.780 --> 01:00:33.060
the weirdest dude.
最古怪的家伙。

1367
01:00:33.380 --> 01:00:33.980
Oh my God.
天哪。

1368
01:00:34.620 --> 01:00:40.160
I remember thinking, I remember doing this audition with, uh, Rain where he, uh, Greg
我记得当时在想，我记得和雷恩一起试镜，格雷格

1369
01:00:40.160 --> 01:00:42.140
