让我请求他帮我接电话。

1370
01:00:42.540 --> 01:00:45.820
And of course he said to Rain under no circumstances, will you cover his phone?
当然，他私下告诉雷恩，无论如何都不要帮他接电话。

1371
01:00:46.340 --> 01:00:50.700
And I remember being like, um, Hey, uh, Dwight, will you just cover my phone?
我记得我当时说，嗯，嘿，德怀特，你能帮我接一下电话吗？

1372
01:00:50.760 --> 01:00:51.680
I just got to go to the bathroom.
我得去趟洗手间。

1373
01:00:51.880 --> 01:00:53.340
And he was like, sorry.
他回答说，抱歉。

1374
01:00:53.600 --> 01:00:55.200
And then pretended to close barn doors.
