但是，她真的会回吻他吗？

1825
01:21:43.360 --> 01:21:44.280
How long should it go on?
要持续多久？

1826
01:21:44.360 --> 01:21:47.860
Like just sort of general chitty chatness about how it would play out.
就像是关于这场戏如何展开的一些闲聊。

1827
01:21:48.540 --> 01:21:53.760
And then I remember on the day doing a very rough blocking of it, but alone.
