他们带我到片场独自排练。

1830
01:22:00.140 --> 01:22:02.080
This is where you're going to stand at Jim's desk.
这就是你要站的地方，在Jim的办公桌旁。

1831
01:22:02.200 --> 01:22:03.160
There was a big discussion.
